hotel_response:
&quot;Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We’re glad to hear you appreciated the privacy curtain on the bed.

We’re very sorry to read about the issues you experienced during your stay. The cleanliness of our bathrooms and kitchen is something we take seriously, and your comments have been shared with our housekeeping team so we can address these concerns. We also regret that the noise issue and your request for assistance were not resolved during your stay, as this is not the level of service we aim to provide.

We truly appreciate you bringing these matters to our attention, as guest feedback helps us improve&quot;

&quot;Thank you for your feedback. We are concerned to hear about the maintenance and safety issues you encountered during your stay, as these do not reflect our standard operating procedures.

Please be assured that we have immediately dispatched our maintenance team to repair the door hardware and shower fixtures mentioned. We are also reviewing our housekeeping protocols and the circumstances surrounding the fire alarm to ensure better communication and comfort for our guests moving forward.

We take these matters seriously and appreciate you bringing them to our attention so they can be rectified.&quot;

